WEBVTT

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:03.540
Hello, and welcome to AI Confidence
Academy.

00:00:04.280 --> 00:00:09.100
I'm Anna, and I'm glad you've made your
way to our enrollment page. Perhaps you've

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:12.420
already spent some time exploring our
website and learning about what the

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:16.880
Academy offers. Maybe you've decided
you're ready to begin, or perhaps you're

00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:18.220
still considering your options.

00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:23.160
Either way, I'd like to take a moment to
help you understand the enrollment process

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:28.560
so you can make a comfortable, informed
decision. AI Confidence Academy offers

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:33.780
two learning phases. Phase 1,
Understanding and Confidence is our

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:34.680
guided foundation.

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:39.340
It's designed to help everyday learners
better understand artificial intelligence,

00:00:39.340 --> 00:00:44.000
become comfortable using it, and develop
confidence through clear instruction,

00:00:44.620 --> 00:00:47.560
practical exercises, and meaningful
participation.

00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:50.600
Phase 2, Capability and Application,

00:00:51.320 --> 00:00:52.520
takes that learning further.

00:00:53.260 --> 00:00:57.880
Here, the emphasis shifts toward applying
AI more purposefully in your everyday

00:00:57.880 --> 00:01:00.480
activities. professional responsibilities,

00:01:01.180 --> 00:01:03.600
business interests, and personal projects.

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:08.860
You may enroll directly in either phase.
Completing phase one is not a requirement

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:13.140
for entering phase two. We encourage you
to choose the learning experience that

00:01:13.140 --> 00:01:18.260
best matches your current understanding
and goals. Now, let's briefly review your

00:01:18.260 --> 00:01:19.060
payment options.

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:25.020
For phase one, enrollment is $129 when
paid in full, or

00:01:25.020 --> 00:01:29.740
you may choose three payments of $50, $50,
and $49,

00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:31.760
totaling $149.

00:01:32.680 --> 00:01:38.140
For Phase 2, enrollment is $179 when paid
in full, or three

00:01:38.140 --> 00:01:39.460
payments of $67,

00:01:40.260 --> 00:01:42.280
$66, and $66,

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:44.740
totaling $199.

00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:50.960
Installment payments are scheduled when
you enroll, seven days later, and 14 days

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:56.380
later. These are payments toward one
course purchase, not a monthly membership.

00:01:56.740 --> 00:01:59.980
Choosing installments includes a
commitment to the scheduled payments.

00:02:00.860 --> 00:02:05.180
There are also a few important things we'd
like you to know before enrolling. Academy

00:02:05.180 --> 00:02:10.560
enrollment is available to adults age 18
and older. Our programs follow a

00:02:10.560 --> 00:02:14.960
guided learning schedule with specific
lesson release times and study periods.

00:02:14.960 --> 00:02:20.060
Most lessons need to be opened within 24
hours of release, and once

00:02:20.060 --> 00:02:24.740
opened, provide 120 minutes of study time
that you can pause and resume.

00:02:25.600 --> 00:02:30.480
Please review the full access conditions,
including any exceptions, so you'll know

00:02:30.480 --> 00:02:35.240
what to expect. We also encourage you to
familiarize yourself with our terms of

00:02:35.240 --> 00:02:35.790
enrollment,

00:02:36.420 --> 00:02:40.720
and use, refund and payment problem
policy, privacy policy,

00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:45.920
and AI learning and automated help
disclaimer. And enrollment purchases are

00:02:45.920 --> 00:02:50.640
generally final and non-refundable for a
change of mind, while any rights provided

00:02:50.640 --> 00:02:55.500
by applicable law remain protected. These
policies are available here on our website

00:02:55.500 --> 00:03:00.080
for your review. Once your payment is
confirmed, you'll receive instructions for

00:03:00.080 --> 00:03:03.960
accessing your private learner portal and
beginning your academy experience.

00:03:04.960 --> 00:03:08.660
And if you're still considering
enrollment, that's perfectly fine. You're

00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:13.120
welcome to continue exploring our website,
join our interest list without making a

00:03:13.120 --> 00:03:16.580
purchase, or contact Academy Support with
any questions.

00:03:17.300 --> 00:03:22.280
At AI Confidence Academy, we believe that
understanding comes through learning and

00:03:22.280 --> 00:03:23.980
confidence grows through participation.

00:03:24.960 --> 00:03:29.060
Thank you for considering the Academy. We
would be delighted to welcome you to our

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:30.010
learning community.

00:03:30.440 --> 00:03:32.200
We look forward to seeing you inside.

